  "description": "Nothing crazy ever happens to Ju-In. He’s just your average college student, keeping his head down and flying under the radar. Ya-Hwi, on the other hand, is drop dead gorgeous, super popular… but also kinda mean. So why has the campus heartthrob taken an interest in a total nobody? There must be an ulterior motive, but it’s hard to care when faced with those killer looks. Will Ju-In become a slave to his desires? Or perhaps he’ll become the master himself… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)",
